      "writtenOn": "2019-01-18T15:18:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ack.\nThis cannot be null as below @NotNull annotation suggested.\nSo I guess we don\u0027t need to say what will happen if it is null or invalid?\n\nAnd yes, we\u0027ve got this implemented correctly by you.\nIf it is null or invalid, ERROR_INVALID_NETWORK will be returned in onError.",
